#
# Vtable.NAT.trimmed — HRRR native (hybrid-level) files for the wave pipeline.
# Derived from WPS 4.6.0's Vtable.RAP.hybrid.ncep by dropping the hydrometeor
# rows (QC/QR/QI/QS/QG/QNR/QNC/QNI/QNWFA/QNIFA — WRF initializes condensate to
# zero) and the soil rows (the soil state comes from the wrfprs SOIL subset,
# which must not be shadowed by the native file's two SOILW records).
# Keeps HGT/PRESSURE/TT/UU/VV/RH (50 hybrid levels), the 2-D fields, LANDSEA
# and SEAICE — roughly 2 GB per time instead of 6 GB.
#
#
#  Vtable for the Rapid refresh (RAP) hybrid-vertical coordinate grib2 files on the ncep server.
#  ftp://ftpprd.ncep.noaa.gov/pub/data/nccf/com/rap/prod/rap.ccyymmdd/
#
#  rap.txxz.awp130bgrbfhh.grib2   13km conus     31 MB (approximate size)
#
#  As of 20 April, 2020
#  hourly to 21 hours
#  Level 1 is near the surface, level 50 is the top.
